      "cooked": "<p>Just thought I would share this:</p><p>About a year ago, I joined a local volunteer EMS organization, where every member is on call 24/7. Normally we only get medical calls, but this morning we got a call for a missing person. We organized at the last known location, and began a search. Each member was assigned a different area, and we went up and down every street and alley. Here's the good news, HE WAS FOUND!!!</p><p>I just hope that everyone is having a great day, and perhaps this piece of news made it a little better.</p>",
